| `evals.case_schema` | string | `config/evals/eval-case.schema.json` | a repo-relative path to a JSON Schema with a `schema_version.const` | `evals/_config.py` | Names the schema every dataset line is held to; the harness takes the case `schema_version` from its `schema_version.const`, and a schema the loader refuses is CONFIG (exit 14), or USAGE (exit 2) for a conflict hunk. A missing schema or one without an integer version is USAGE. | the version itself, which only the schema file states | always |
